<title>USA: Continental offers sale on spring/summer.</title>
<headline>Continental offers sale on spring/summer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines said Thursday that it will offer special sale fares on spring and summer travel in the U.S., Canada and to Europe and Latin America.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering savings up to 50 percent off regular 21-day advance purchase fares.</p>
<p>All tickets must be bought by February 14.</p>
<p>The company said domestic fares apply to trips through September 30 and require a 21-day advance purchase. Fares to Latin America require no advance purchase, and tickets to Europe require a three-day advance, the company said.</p>
</text>
